  { .code = "IN_H2O"; .why = "QUDT states the inch of water at 249.080024 Pa; an inch of the CONVENTIONAL column (9806.65 Pa/m, which QUDT's own FT_H2O agrees with) is 249.088891. 36 ppm apart — a different water density, not a different spelling"; },
